p 2428 1600 100 0 -1 COMMENT7:of the wires along an identical path.
p 2428 1568 100 0 -1 COMMENT8:I sense a subtle Capfast bug here. Beware
p 2428 1536 100 0 -1 COMMENT9:when making any changes to this schematic.
